A(('p', '4.3 What Jesus does not identify. The passage names many parts and leaves each without an explanation. Jesus does not identify the one who is bidden. Jesus does not identify the wedding, the highest room or the lowest room. Jesus does not identify the one who bade, or the more honourable man. Jesus does not identify him that bade him, the friends, the brethren, the kinsmen or the rich neighbours. Jesus does not identify the poor, the maimed, the lame or the blind. Jesus does not identify the feast. Jesus does not identify the just or the resurrection of the just.'))
